Build one unified product:

ENTERPRISE VALUE PROTECTION & DECISION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

The system helps enterprise management understand:

- Which products and projects are strategically important.
- Which commitments and values are exposed to risk.
- Which Issues threaten or enable those commitments.
- Which Solution Candidates can address those Issues.
- What resources and constraints affect each alternative.
- Which decisions require management attention.
