- Specialist skills.
- Time-critical engineering and quality approvals.

Commitment-bearing:
- Delivery capacity.
- Contractual milestones.
- Customer obligations.
- Business continuity.

Effectiveness and Efficiency must remain separate dimensions.

Apply hard safety, legal, technical, authority, and liquidity constraints before comparing feasible alternatives.

Do not collapse all dimensions into one opaque score.

